<title>SPAIN: Spain to issue a Eurobond for 2.0 billion ecu-euro.</title>
<headline>Spain to issue a Eurobond for 2.0 billion ecu-euro.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Treasury said on Thursday that it would issue a new Eurobond denominated in Euro-Ecu for around 2.0 billion.</p>
<p>It added that it was still studying the issue, which is expected to have a 10-year maturity and to be reopened later on.</p>
<p>Treasury added that the issue is expected to be announced between 15 and 30 days.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
